// Honest framing: oversight is part of the managed service; exact scope agreed per engagement.
---
<div class="sup-card reveal">
  <span class="sup-badge">Oversight included</span>
  <h2>Managed means we stay involved.</h2>
  <p>You are never just handed a remote hire and left to manage it alone. Every engagement includes structured onboarding and a defined level of service oversight, so quality stays high and the working relationship keeps improving. The exact scope of oversight is agreed with you up front.</p>
  <div class="sup-points">
    <div class="sup-point">
      <span class="sup-ico"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l2.3 4.7 5.2.8-3.8 3.6.9 5.1L12 14.8 7.4 16.2l.9-5.1L4.5 7.5l5.2-.8z"></path></svg></span>
      <div><h3>Structured onboarding</h3><p>Role responsibilities, access, and documented procedures set up from the start.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sup-point">
      <span class="sup-ico"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 11l3 3 7-7"></path><path d="M20 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9"></path></svg></span>
      <div><h3>Quality oversight</h3><p>Check-ins and work reviews appropriate to the contracted service.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="sup-point">
      <span class="sup-ico"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg></span>
      <div><h3>Clear communication</h3><p>Regular updates and a straightforward way to raise anything that needs attention.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
